    "text": "\n\n-- 1 of 2 --\n\nwww.freepressjournal.in\t6 \tMumbai, Saturday, May 10, 2025\tTHE FREE PRESS JOURNAL\nNotice is hereby given that the certificates for the below mentioned securities of the\nCompany have been lost/ misplaced and the holders of the said securities have applied\nto the Company for Duplicate certificate. Any person who has claim in any respect of the\nsaid securities should lodge such claim with the company at its Registered office within\n30 days from this date else Company will proceed to issue duplicate share certificate\nwithout future intimation.\nPlace Hinganghat\nDate: 08/05/2025\nName of Share Holders:-\nSudhir Daulatchandji Kothari and Saroj Sudhir Kothari\nBehind Balaji Mandir, Jagannath Ward,\nHinganghat Dist. Wardha 442301\nUltraTech Cement Ltd.\n\"B\" Wing, 2nd floor,\nAhura Centre, Mahakali Caves Road,\nAndheri (East) Mumbai - 400 09\nRegistrar and Transfer Agent\nKFin Technologies Limited, Selenium Tower B,\nPlot Nos. 31 & 32, Financial District, Nanakramguda\nSerilingampally Mandal, Hyderabad - 500 032\nSudhir\nDaulatchandji\nKothari jointly\nwith Saroj\nSudhir Kothari\nShareholders\nName\nFolio No. Kind of\nSecurities No of\nSecurities\nCertificate\nNos. Distinctive Nos\n36196686-36196805\t75415214 \t120 \t138605\tEquity\nTender Notice\nMCGM Center For Municipal\nCapacity Building & Research\n(MCMCR) is inviting tenders\nfor \t“Annual \tContract \tfor\nproviding \tHousehold\nManagement Services” and\n“Annual Contract for providing\nelectrical services & plumbing\nservices” at MCMCR, Powai for\nyear 2025-26. For more details,\nplease visit Tender Tab on\nwww.mcmcr.mcgm.gov.in\nSd/-\nDirector (MCMCR)\n\n-- 2 of 2 --\n\n"
